<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#1c1e21;max-width:640px">
  <p style="background:#fdeced;border-left:3px solid #c0392b;padding:10px 14px;margin:0 0 18px">
    An expired enrollment code was presented for redemption. It was refused and no certificate was
    issued.
  </p>
  <p>
    Two things cause this, and they need opposite responses. Either a job you still want is failing
    on schedule and needs re-enrolling, or a credential you thought was gone is still in
    circulation. If the address below is not a host you recognize, treat the code as leaked and
    audit what it was used for while it was still live.
  </p>

  <h3 style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b7280">The attempt</h3>
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px">
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Attempted at</td><td style="padding:4px 0">{{ datetime .AttemptedAt }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Source address</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ .SourceIP }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Code expired</td><td style="padding:4px 0">{{ datetime .CodeExpiredAt }}</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h3 style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b7280">The code itself</h3>
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:14px">
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Principal</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ if .ServiceAccount }}{{ .ServiceAccount }}{{ else }}{{ join .Principals ", " }}{{ end }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Key ID</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ .KeyID }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Bound key</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;word-break:break-all">{{ .PublicKeyType }} {{ .PublicKeyFingerprint }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Enrollment ID</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ .EnrollmentID }}</td></tr>
    {{ if .RequestID }}<tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;color:#6b7280;white-space:nowrap">Request ID</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace">{{ .RequestID }}</td></tr>{{ end }}
  </table>
  <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px">
    The caller was told only that the code is unknown: an expired code and one that never existed
    answer identically, so whoever holds it learns nothing from the refusal. You will not get
    another message about this enrollment for a while, however often the attempt repeats.
  </p>

  {{ if .ServerURL }}<p style="font-size:13px"><a href="{{ .ServerURL }}/service-codes/{{ .EnrollmentID }}" style="color:#1d4ed8">This code, and every redemption of it</a>.</p>{{ end }}

  <p style="margin-top:28px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#9099a8;font-size:12px">
    Sent because "Expired enrollment code used" is on in your
    {{ if .ServerURL }}<a href="{{ .ServerURL }}/preferences" style="color:#6b7280">notification preferences</a>{{ else }}notification preferences{{ end }},
    or because this address is set as the enrollment's notification address.
  </p>
</div>
